    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>Gain three background points in a stage combat background, such as stage fencing, knife-throwing or gladiatorial show combat.</p>\n<p>When you make a melee or thrown weapon attack with a&nbsp;bladed weapon, you can reroll a natural 2 on the attack roll. If you are fighting with two weapons, you can also reroll a natural 3.</p>\n<p>You can trigger your bard battle cries with thrown weapon attacks.</p>"
